      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1000,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sequential Execution with Backward Compensation on Failure:\n1. Reserve Hostname Lock in DynamoDB hostnames table (attribute_not_exists)\n2. Request / Validate Certificate in AWS Certificate Manager (ACM)\n3. Upsert Public/Private DNS Alias in Amazon Route 53 (points to NLB)\n4. Provision / Associate Edge Distribution in Amazon CloudFront\n5. Execute TCP Reachability Verification on Backend Host & Port\n6. Mark Tenant ACTIVE in DynamoDB tenants table\n* Compensation: On any step failure, preceding steps are undone in reverse order!",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sequential Execution with Backward Compensation on Failure:\n1. Reserve Hostname Lock in DynamoDB hostnames table (attribute_not_exists)\n2. Request / Validate Certificate in AWS Certificate Manager (ACM)\n3. Upsert Public/Private DNS Alias in Amazon Route 53 (points to NLB)\n4. Provision / Associate Edge Distribution in Amazon CloudFront\n5. Execute TCP Reachability Verification on Backend Host & Port\n6. Mark Tenant ACTIVE in DynamoDB tenants table\n* Compensation: On any step failure, preceding steps are undone in reverse order!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
